# Optional path to config written by `npm run demo`.
# MINTIQ_CONFIG=.mintiq/local.json

# The demo uses the built-in rule-based scorer (no LLM).
# Live NEAR AI Cloud judging is optional and OFF by default, even if a key is set.
# Turn it on only with a funded account: NEARAI_JUDGE=1 and NEARAI_API_KEY=...
# Do not put private keys in this file. The API key is read only by the agent
# process (app/src/evaluator.js). It is never sent to the browser or baked into
# the dashboard bundle. An unfunded key returns HTTP 402; leaving the judge flag
# off prevents those errors from hitting the demo logs.
# NEARAI_JUDGE=0
# NEARAI_API_KEY=
# NEAR_AI_API_KEY=
# NEAR_AI_BASE_URL=https://cloud-api.near.ai/v1
# Optional override; if unset, the agent picks from the live GET /v1/models catalog
# (prefers z-ai/glm-5.2 or zai-org/GLM-5.1-FP8 when listed, otherwise a current GLM successor).
# NEAR_AI_MODEL=

# Live Agent Market credentials are optional and unused for spending.
# A real job on market.near.ai charges USD or USDC; there is no documented testnet.
# MARKET_AAT_TOKEN=
# MARKET_BUYER_SESSION=
